e is 2.0
e is 10.0
e is 2.0
e is 10.0
e is 2.0
e is 10.0
e is 2.0
e is 10.0
e is 2.0
want of ["WE5 large-amp oscillation does not fire (variance)", equilibrium, false]

# WE6: alternating +/-1 raw steps are motion, not equilibrium.
f is 800.0
f is 801.0
f is 800.0
f is 801.0
f is 800.0
f is 801.0
f is 800.0
f is 801.0
f is 800.0
f is 801.0
f is 800.0
# #861 re-pin: value route: 800<->801 is a real +/-1 perpetual oscillation (#422) — an active-motion band, exclusive of equilibrium; the entropy channel saw dH~1.5e-5 and called it rest
want of ["WE6 unit alternation does not fire", equilibrium, false]

